pakiti (3.0.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Support for installations with multiple package managers
  * The communication protocol extended by utilizing the URL query string
    to pass auxiliary information to the server
  * Support of Devuan and FreeBSD systems
  * Added --mode option to specify how the server should process the report
  * Added --no-protocol-version and --debug options
  * Various fixes and improvements

 -- Daniel Kouril <kouril@ics.muni.cz>  Fri, 08 Sep 2017 17:57:46 +0200
